ctors to put  miguel on life support falling from a  balcony and crashing onto a hard railing  probably broke some bones or severely  damaged miguel's spine and paralysis  would be a likely result from these  injuries  still it's also fair to have an  optimistic view of miguel's injuries  right now fans only know that he's badly  injured and the specifics of his  condition are unknown with so much room  for taos there's no way to know how  serious his condition is  people walk away from frightening falls  all the time plus like  any television show cobra kai isn't  firmly restricted by the laws of reality  it's entirely possible that miguel will  emerge from the hospital bed with his  ability to walk fully intact  sure that probably won't happen but it's  possible one thing we know for sure that  this request from the season 2 finale  probably won't be honored no more karate  okay  all right amanda i know you're right no  more karate  the thrilling conclusion to the previous  season left fans with many questions  and the teaser trailer for the show's  return only increased the intrigue  on top of everything both season 1 and  season 2 have teased the return of ali  mills now annie mills schwaber and  the final shot of the finale hinted that  she may finally enter the story  could johnny and daniel's old flame have  a hand in helping miguel recover  after all she is a surgeon for someone  who hasn't talked to ally in decades you  sure know an awful lot about her  i've seen her on facebook what's a  facebook  fans will just have to wait for the  return of cobra kai to discover how it  all plays out  thankfully they won't have to wait too  long cobra kai season 3 is set to arrive  on netflix on january 8th  2021 check out one of our newest videos  right here plus even more looper videos  about your favorite shows are coming  soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one
 

